OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste charity gets grant for
OL,4,Arising costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that is helping tackle the
OL,7,Fissue of food waste has received a
OL,8,Ffunding grant from the council.
OL,10,FShrewsbury Food Hub collects surplus
OL,11,Ffood from supermarkets, manufacturers
OL,12,Fand farms, and shares it with 90
OL,13,Fcommunity groups and 13 weekly food
OL,14,Fshares.
OL,16,FEarlier this month, it was announced
OL,17,Fthe charity received a #60,000 grant,
OL,18,Fover three years, from Shrewsbury Town
OL,19,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
